<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-054" chapter-id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051" source-id="s-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051">
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001:m0000" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">孫拯</persName>者，字<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001:m0005" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">顯世</persName>，吳都富春人也。能屬文，仕吳為黃門郎。<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001:m0026" ref="05e_9bb_55a">孫皓</persName>世，侍臣多得罪，惟<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001:m0037" ref="6k9_dku_2e4_AA">拯</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-054-sunzheng-wu051:p001:m0039" ref="wtz_smr_dwz">顧榮</persName>以智全。吳平後，為涿令，有稱績。</p>
</text>
